# Services

- Classify sources before network: empty / local resource / file / HTTP(S).
- Memory + disk cache: size limits, TTL, atomic disk writes, unique temp files.
- Loader: in-flight dedupe, retry only transient failures (408/429/5xx, timeouts, network). Do not retry SSL failures.
- Respect `MaxImageSizeBytes` and per-attempt timeout.
